{"title":"Photo Scarves \u0026 Ties","description":"\u003cp style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"\/collections\/other-photo-gifts\"\u003eAll Other\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/photo-towels\"\u003eTowels\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/collections\/photo-scarves-ties\"\u003eScarves \u0026amp; Ties\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca href=\"\/products\/personalized-photo-mousepad\"\u003eMousepads\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"personalized-photo-fleece-scarf","title":"Personalized Photo Fleece Scarf","description":"\u003cp\u003ePersonalized winter Scarf, made from soft Fleece, 61\" x 8\". Turn your photos into a winter fashion statement!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"feat-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial: \u003c\/strong\u003e100% Polyester Polar Fleece\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"feat-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e Dye Sublimation\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"feat-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 3-5 Business Days.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41408270403,"sku":"SCRF-RGF","price":39.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-apparel-valentine-s-day-gifts-other-products-personalized-photo-fleece-scarf-1.jpg?v=1506962139"},{"product_id":"personalized-photo-neck-tie","title":"Personalized Photo Neck Tie","description":"\u003cp\u003eA personalized poly-satin necktie, 3.5\" x 56\". A classy fashion accessory, these ties make great presentation pieces for your favorite photo.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"feat-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e 100% Polyester, Poly-Satin\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"feat-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Process:\u003c\/strong\u003e﻿ Dye Sublimation\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"feat-name\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships in 5-7 Business Days.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41408291843,"sku":"SUBNTIE","price":34.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/photo-apparel-other-products-personalized-photo-neck-tie-1.jpg?v=1506962203"},{"product_id":"8-x-21-photo-christmas-stocking","title":"8\" x 21\" Photo Christmas Stocking","description":"\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eBack again for the Holiday Season; the Photo Christmas Stocking!\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e8\" x 21\", and comes ready to hang. Our talented designers have created a high quality design in the spirit of the holidays to frame your photo before it's printed onto the stocking.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e 100% Polyester, Coarse Weave Poly-Duck Fabric\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships out in 4 to 6 Business Days after final proof approval.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eProofing included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43842179395,"sku":"8x21STOCKING-HS19","price":34.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/holiday-gifts-8-x-21-photo-christmas-stocking-1.jpg?v=1501185563"},{"product_id":"17-photo-christmas-stocking","title":"17\" Photo Christmas Stocking","description":"\u003cstrong\u003eWe had them last year, and they're back! Photo Christmas Stockings!\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eOur talented designers have created a high quality design to frame your photo before it's printed onto the stocking. This product is available in two different fabrics:\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCoarse Weave Fabric\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eA 100% polyester fabric with a visible weave. Its texture is comparable to canvas. Stockings made from this fabric come without a lining.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFleece Fabric\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eThis fabric is much like the fleece our Polar Fleece Blankets are made from; it is soft and smooth to the touch. Stockings made from this fabric come with a lining, available in the following colors:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhite\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003eRed\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong\u003eGreen\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduction Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Ships out in 4 to 6 Business Days after final proof approval.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cem\u003eProofing included.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e \u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/files\/PT_ProductBadge.png?v=1509137419\" alt=\"\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"vendor-unknown","offers":[{"title":"Coarse Weave (No Lining)","offer_id":37758104707,"sku":"17STOCKING-PlyCnvs","price":23.74,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Fleece \/w White Lining","offer_id":43842032259,"sku":"17STOCKING-WhtLng","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Fleece \/w Red Lining","offer_id":43842032323,"sku":"17STOCKING-RedLng","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Fleece \/w Green Lining","offer_id":43842032387,"sku":"17STOCKING-GrnLng","price":24.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1336\/2769\/products\/holiday-gifts-17-photo-christmas-stocking-1.jpg?v=1501185556"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.personalthrows.com\/collections\/photo-scarves-ties.oembed","provider":"PersonalThrows","version":"1.0","type":"link"}